Description: Fail closed on invalid Unisoc power readback and activation prerequisites
 Keep the successful RIL command order and existing pre-dial replay. Never
 guess 134/134 after a failed mode query or continue after a mandatory power
 command fails. Propagate initialization errors and release parent port state.
Author: e5-linux
Forwarded: no

